# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# and fisher-l7f owner decisions. Written 2026-11-22.
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok.
< readyok
> go
# The owner uses the starting position before any position command.
< bestmove {legal}
# UCI position/go and bestmove. The owner chooses a random legal move.
> position startpos
> go
< bestmove {legal}
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
